{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17832","headline":"胡二十拜户部兼判度支 · 杨巨源","name":"胡二十拜户部兼判度支","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清机果被公材挠，雄拜知承圣主恩。\n庙略已调天府实，国征方觉地官尊。\n徒言玉节将分阃，定是沙堤欲到门。\n爲爱山前新卜第，不妨风月事琴罇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17832.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17832","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}